OL,3,AResident Evil Requiem sweeps Golden
OL,4,AJoystick Awards
OL,5,
OL,6,FResident Evil Requiem and its makers
OL,7,Fhave won big at the Golden Joystick
OL,8,FAwards, which celebrate the year's most
OL,9,Fpopular games.
OL,11,FReleased in February, it was the latest
OL,12,Finstalment of the global survival
OL,13,Fhorror phenomenon, which has also
OL,14,Fspawned books, films and TV programmes
OL,15,Fsince it was first released 30 years
OL,16,Fago.
OL,23,APub: 12-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBCultureC Nat RadioFTechnology
FL,167,160,200,105,0,100
