OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.*,%-,* *,%%**,$ ,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,AResident Evil Requiem sweeps Golden
OL,4,AJoystick Awards
OL,5,
OL,6,FAt Wednesday's awards ceremony, it
OL,7,Fscooped ultimate game of the year,
OL,8,Fconsole game of the year, best game
OL,9,Ftrailer, and best lead performer for
OL,10,Fthe game's star Angela Sant'Albano, who
OL,11,Fplays protagonist Grace Ashcroft.
OL,13,FMeanwhile its makers, Japanese studio
OL,14,FCapcom, was named studio of the year
OL,15,Fand was also recognised for other
OL,16,Fgames, including Onimusha: Way of the
OL,17,FSword and Pragmata.
